<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10099] ClusterNodeAttributeAffinityBackupFilter isn&apos;t available in Java config</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10099</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Original issue: &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9365&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9365&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;ClusterNodeAttributeAffinityBackupFilter is available only in Spring config, because constructor is package-private.&lt;br/&gt;
For support Java config, we should make constructor public.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
